  "body": "Milford living, right where you want to be.\r\n\r\nFeatures that you'll love:\r\n* North-facing apartment to enjoy the afternoon sun\r\n* Spacious open plan kitchen/dining/living\r\n* Designer kitchen, onsite gym area and swimming pool \r\n* Pop downstairs for your shopping and morning coffee \r\n* Easily maintained lock up & leave\r\n* 2 secure carparks\r\n* Close proximity to Smales Farm, bus and public transport, North Shore Hospital, Milford Mall & shopping centre, motorways, beaches and amenities\r\n* School zoned for Double Westlake, Milford School & Takapuna Normal Intermediate\r\n\r\nThere is a lot to like about life in the heart of Milford, and this beautifully presented apartment puts you right in the middle of it all.  With an overseas vendor who is genuinely motivated to sell, this is an opportunity worth putting on your viewing list. It is a lovely apartment, in a brilliant location, and is definitely worthy of your attention.\r\n\r\nNorth-facing and filled with sunshine, the home feels warm, spacious and easy from the moment you walk through the door. The spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is the perfect place to relax or entertain, flowing naturally to a private balcony where you can enjoy your morning coffee in the sun or wind down with a glass of wine at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is stylish without being fussy, with quality appliances and everything you need to make entertaining or everyday cooking a pleasure. Two generous bedrooms and two beautifully appointed bathrooms provide space for guests, family or simply spreading out and enjoying the extra room.\r\n\r\nThere are some really lovely finishes throughout too. Rich hardwood floors, elegant French windows, underfloor heating and an integrated ventilation system all add to the feeling that this is a home that has been thoughtfully put together, rather than just another apartment.\r\n\r\nThen there is the location, which is hard to beat.  Step outside and Milford Village is right there. Cafes, restaurants, boutique shops, the supermarket, medical facilities and public transport are all within easy walking distance. Milford Beach is also just moments away, making it incredibly easy to enjoy a swim, a walk along the sand or a coffee by the water whenever the mood takes you.\r\n\r\nProperties of this quality, in such a tightly held location, do not come along often. With our overseas vendor motivated and committed to achieving a sale, we strongly recommend making time to see this one for yourself.  Come for the location. Stay for the lifestyle. \r\n\r\nPrivate viewings available. Motivated vendor. This property must be sold!",
